  "releaseNotes": "## New Apps\n* Bump `net_conduit_tcp` from `1.0.2` to `1.1.2`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_tcp/1.0.2...net_conduit_tcp/1.1.2)\n* Bump `net_conduit_websocket` from `1.0.2` to `1.1.2`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_websocket/1.0.2...net_conduit_websocket/1.1.2)\n\n## New Version\n* Bump `net_conduit` from `1.0.1` to `1.1.2`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit/1.0.1...net_conduit/1.1.2)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Use conditional references for NetConduit dependency by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/20\n* Bump xunit.runner.visualstudio from 2.8.2 to 3.1.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/18\n* Bump Nuke.Common from 10.0.0 to 10.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/15\n* Bump Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk from 17.12.0 to 18.0.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/14\n* Bump coverlet.collector from 6.0.2 to 6.0.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/12\n* Bump xunit from 2.9.2 to 2.9.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/16\n* Bump xunit.runner.visualstudio from 3.0.2 to 3.1.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/22\n* Introduce adaptive flow control for improved performance by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/23\n* Bump BenchmarkDotNet from 0.14.0 to 0.15.8 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/11\n* Bump Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk from 17.14.0 to 18.0.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/21\n\n## New Contributors\n* @dependabot[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/18\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/build.20251204190256.4f8d5d6...build.20251204221330.f94a1db\n\n---\n\n## Asset Hashes\n| Asset | Hashes |\n|---|---|\n| **[net_conduit.zip](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/releases/download/build.20251204221330.f94a1db/net_conduit.zip)** | <details><summary>Click to expand</summary> **MD5:** `724ae27b30cf33aea62d3971b842577e`<br> **SHA-1:** `8152d511c5a8f2b7047e1ffcc5f431744c0695fc`<br> **SHA-256:** `a94fd95550693821f5c42e3d086f9f5273d794e15400c733c8e91dd0550a3709`<br> **SHA-512:** `8a6a61c89118f9acae42da6790740e4bbea7ce049660007f81008ce7115e8260ae24c7ae2b9506abe4cd6cc916ce0ebf21098a05715e2cab8357c9a0a062b7f3`<br> </details> |",
